           _i_n_t _t___s_e_g_q_l_e_n              The current number of segments in the
                                      reassembly queue.

           _u___i_n_t _f_l_o_w_i_d               Flowid for the connection.  A caveat:
                                      Zero '0' either represents a valid
                                      flowid or a default value when the
                                      flowid is not being set.

           _u___i_n_t _f_l_o_w_t_y_p_e             Flow type for the connection.  Flowtype
                                      defines which protocol fields are hashed
                                      to produce the flowid.  A complete list‐
                                      ing is available in
                                      _/_u_s_r_/_i_n_c_l_u_d_e_/_s_y_s_/_m_b_u_f_._h under
                                      M_HASHTYPE_*.

